  "rationale": "Starting only from wifiGuest:initialAccess, the attacker can reach configSecret:credentialAccess, containerHost:execution, fileServer:lateralMovement, memoryDump:credentialAccess, rdpLogin:authenticate and mailArchive:collection. Nothing else opens up. browserStore:credentialAccess needs workstation, iotDevice or phishing, and none of these are reachable. That blocks vpnSession, dbLogin, appServer and domainAdmin. tokenCache:credentialAccess needs iotDevice, vpnGateway or workstation, so it is blocked, and so are printServer and jumpHost (sshKey needs exposedApi). backupHost needs apiToken or ssoLogin, and both are blocked. As a result serviceAccount, secretsManager and hypervisor are also blocked. All four parents of crownData:exfiltrate stay unreachable: shareMount, vaultRead, dbReplica and codeRepo. The target therefore cannot be reached."
